==================================================================================
R1 -- Vandermonde = signed tournament sum; intransitive cancel, transitive survive
==================================================================================
  n=3: signed tournament sum == Vandermonde: True | #transitive=6 (=n! ? True) | surviving score-buckets all perms of 0..n-1: True (#buckets=6)
  n=4: signed tournament sum == Vandermonde: True | #transitive=24 (=n! ? True) | surviving score-buckets all perms of 0..n-1: True (#buckets=24)
  n=5: signed tournament sum == Vandermonde: True | #transitive=120 (=n! ? True) | surviving score-buckets all perms of 0..n-1: True (#buckets=120)
  involution (n=4): reverse the lex-min directed 3-cycle ...
    intransitive tournaments paired: 40; every pair score-preserving & sign-flipping: True

